+/// Tier-2a Change D: the fully materialized inner-side abstraction buffer
+/// used by [`Subsume::filter_matching_lazy`], either borrowed from
+/// [`DEPTH0_CACHE`] (`Cached`, when the result is being kept alive across
+/// many future `Subsume` instances) or computed into `Subsume`'s pooled
